John --

Yesterday, to mark the legacy of Dr. Martin Luther King, Jr., President =
Obama spoke at the Vermont Avenue Baptist Church, in Washington, D.C.

It was a stirring speech that reminds us of the lessons that Dr. King and =
his generation still hold for us as we confront the challenges of today.

Please watch the President here:

http://my.barackobama.com/MLKDayVideo

And please forward this message along to anyone you know who would be =
interested.

Thanks,

Mitch

Mitch Stewart
Director
Organizing for America




